Description: AllStar node dashboard
 SM-Elite is a web dashboard for AllStarLink 3 nodes. One service holds the
 Asterisk manager connection and pushes live node status to every browser
 over a single websocket.
 .
 It shows connected links, keyups, last heard, voters, and favorites with
 network activity, and lets operators connect, monitor, disconnect, send
 DTMF, make text-to-speech announcements, manage allow and deny lists, and
 switch DVSwitch modes and talkgroups. Admins can reload or restart Asterisk,
 edit rpt.conf, iax.conf, and extensions.conf with automatic backups, and
 manage users.
 .
 The package configures itself from rpt.conf and manager.conf and publishes
 the dashboard through Apache at /sm-elite/.
